This repository contains an academic AI course project for Brain MRI Tumor Classification 
and Explainable AI (Grad-CAM), completed under the guidance of Dr. Syed Wajid Alam.

1. PERMITTED USE
----------------
Permission is granted to academic institutions, instructors, and students to:
(a) Inspect, run, and review the source code for grading, educational demonstration, and project evaluation.
(b) Run the training and evaluation scripts locally for verification and academic demonstration.

2. RESTRICTIONS
---------------
(a) The codebase may not be commercialized, packaged into closed-source commercial software, or resold.
(b) Any reuse or academic presentation of this work must credit the student developers (Dar Rehan Rasool & Shafiya Pampori) 
    and faculty supervisor (Dr. Syed Wajid Alam).

3. DISCLAIMER
-------------
This software was engineered as an educational AI project and benchmark demonstration. 
It is not an FDA/CE-certified clinical diagnostic medical device.
